[Options]

[A.]
<h2>War Fortress</h2>
<i>"Look at the size of that thing!"<br>
--Deceased Scout Island Beta Commander</i>  

<p>First: The previous attack was made by no less then the arch-enemy of DDC: The Razorians. Somehow they managed to keep the guild together after the defeat of Lord Razor.
<p>Second: Scout Island Beta (SIB) was scouting the nearby area, when suddenly something REAL big attacked them. Their last words by Balloon: "<I>This message is of utmost urgency! Even now, our island is being pounded by a gigantic Razorian War Fortress. It's heading straight for the DDC-Center! Stop it before it is too late! Farewell...</I>". They're dead now, and it was our best armed Scout Island. You and (promoted) Captain Martin are send out to stop it. Good luck, and if we don't see you back, farewell.

<p>Arriving there, you quickly surrounded the Fortress with bridges, leaving no escape way open.

<p>Your mission is to destroy the Razorian War Fortress and prevent it from reaching the DDC-Center.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Great battle!</h2>
<p>
We've done it once again, my noble friend! Let's get back to DDC for our next mission.

<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Razorianreturn3

[ai2PriestDead]
<p>Captain Martin is dead. We have lost a most valuable officer, and you have lost your best friend!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You are dead! The War Fortress quickly defeated Captain Martin and slaughtered all of DDC!

